title: "agentdryrun: a dry run for AI agents"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: "ntinosgkiou-code"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ntinosgkiou-code/agentdryrun"
version: 0.7.1
date-released: 2026-10-25
abstract: >-
  Record an AI agent's tool calls, judge them against a rules file as a dry run (would pass, would need approval,
  would be refused), and keep a tamper-evident record that a third party can verify offline. Local, standard library only.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - dry-run
  - tool-calling
  - audit-trail
  - transparency-log
